      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MADDIE'S LAKODA (3) continues to build a strong record, last start jumping favourite and hit the ground running, leading throughout to score (21.99) at this track in Maiden over 390m. Brilliant beginner who should be leading the way here. Won at her only start from this box. Expected to be right there at the finish again. CANYA LET LOOSE (2) has been out of the placings at his last two starts but prior to that clocked an exceptional 21.65 win over 390m at this track. Smart winner three back and looks a key chance on that form. HILLTOP SMILE (4) was safely held last time out, finishing sixth at this track over 390m behind Tick Girl (22.53) in a Grade 6. Scored at her previous run. Can measure up this time. HEADMASTER (7) jumps at a shorter distance and still warrants respect.",
